# 快速參考指南

## 常用指令速查

### Gatsby 開發指令
```bash
# 啟動開發伺服器
npm run develop
gatsby develop

# 建置專案
npm run build
gatsby build

# 預覽建置結果
npm run serve
gatsby serve

# 清理快取和建置檔案
npm run clean
gatsby clean

# 開啟 GraphiQL 介面
http://localhost:8000/___graphql
```

### 專案管理
```bash
# 安裝依賴
npm install

# 新增套件
npm install package-name
npm install -D package-name  # 開發依賴

# 檢查過時套件
npm outdated

# 更新套件
npm update
```

## 程式碼範本

### React 函式元件範本
```javascript
import React from "react";
import styles from "./ComponentName.module.scss";

const ComponentName = ({ children, className, ...props }) => {
  return (
    <div 
      className={`${styles.container} ${className || ''}`} 
      {...props}
    >
      {children}
    </div>
  );
};

export default ComponentName;
```

### Gatsby 頁面元件範本
```javascript
import React from "react";
import { Layout, Seo } from "../components";

const PageName = () => {
  return (
    <Layout>
      <div>
        <h1>頁面標題</h1>
        {/* 頁面內容 */}
      </div>
    </Layout>
  );
};

export const Head = () => (
  <>
    <html lang="zh-Hant-TW" />
    <Seo title="頁面標題" description="頁面描述" />
  </>
);

export default PageName;
```

### GraphQL 查詢範本
```javascript
import { graphql, useStaticQuery } from "gatsby";

const ComponentWithQuery = () => {
  const data = useStaticQuery(graphql`
    query {
      site {
        siteMetadata {
          title
          description
        }
      }
    }
  `);

  return (
    <div>
      <h1>{data.site.siteMetadata.title}</h1>
    </div>
  );
};
```

### 頁面查詢範本
```javascript
export const query = graphql`
  query($slug: String!) {
    markdownRemark(fields: { slug: { eq: $slug } }) {
      frontmatter {
        title
        date
      }
      html
      excerpt
    }
  }
`;
```

## SCSS 樣式範本

### 模組化樣式範本
```scss
// component.module.scss
@import "../../styles/color";
@import "../../styles/mixin";

.container {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  
  @include mobile {
    flex-direction: row;
  }
}

.title {
  color: $primary_color;
  font-size: 2rem;
  
  &:hover {
    color: $secondary_color;
  }
}
```

### 響應式設計 Mixin
```scss
// 在 _mixin.scss 中定義
@mixin mobile {
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    @content;
  }
}

@mixin tablet {
  @media (min-width: 769px) and (max-width: 1024px) {
    @content;
  }
}

@mixin desktop {
  @media (min-width: 1025px) {
    @content;
  }
}
```

## Material-UI 整合範本

### 基本元件使用
```javascript
import React from "react";
import { 
  Container, 
  Box, 
  Typography, 
  Button,
  IconButton 
} from "@mui/material";
import { ArrowForward } from "@mui/icons-material";

const MUIComponent = () => {
  return (
    <Container maxWidth="lg">
      <Box sx={{ py: 4 }}>
        <Typography variant="h4" component="h1" gutterBottom>
          標題
        </Typography>
        <Button 
          variant="contained" 
          endIcon={<ArrowForward />}
          sx={{ mt: 2 }}
        >
          按鈕
        </Button>
      </Box>
    </Container>
  );
};
```

### 主題客製化
```javascript
import { createTheme, ThemeProvider } from "@mui/material/styles";

const theme = createTheme({
  palette: {
    primary: {
      main: "#469ad5",
    },
    secondary: {
      main: "#4296d1",
    },
  },
  typography: {
    fontFamily: '"Noto Sans TC", sans-serif',
  },
});

// 在根元件中使用
<ThemeProvider theme={theme}>
  {/* 應用內容 */}
</ThemeProvider>
```

## Gatsby Node.js 範本

### 建立頁面範本
```javascript
// gatsby-node.js
const path = require("path");

exports.createPages = async ({ graphql, actions }) => {
  const { createPage } = actions;

  const result = await graphql(`
    query {
      allMarkdownRemark {
        edges {
          node {
            fields {
              slug
            }
            frontmatter {
              title
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  `);

  result.data.allMarkdownRemark.edges.forEach(({ node }) => {
    createPage({
      path: node.fields.slug,
      component: path.resolve("src/templates/article-template.js"),
      context: {
        slug: node.fields.slug,
      },
    });
  });
};
```

## 除錯和效能調校

### 效能分析
```javascript
// 使用 React DevTools Profiler
import { Profiler } from "react";

const onRenderCallback = (id, phase, actualDuration) => {
  console.log('Profiler:', { id, phase, actualDuration });
};

<Profiler id="ComponentName" onRender={onRenderCallback}>
  <ComponentName />
</Profiler>
```

### 延遲載入元件
```javascript
import { lazy, Suspense } from "react";

const LazyComponent = lazy(() => import("./LazyComponent"));

const ParentComponent = () => {
  return (
    <Suspense fallback={<div>載入中...</div>}>
      <LazyComponent />
    </Suspense>
  );
};
```

## Git 工作流程快捷指令

### 常用 Git 指令
```bash
# 檢查狀態
git status

# 暫存檔案
git add .
git add src/components/

# 提交變更
git commit -m "feat: 新增元件功能"

# 推送到遠端
git push origin master

# 拉取最新變更
git pull origin master

# 建立新分支
git checkout -b feature/new-component

# 切換分支
git checkout master
git checkout develop
```

### 分支管理
```bash
# 查看所有分支
git branch -a

# 刪除本地分支
git branch -d feature/old-feature

# 刪除遠端分支
git push origin --delete feature/old-feature

# 合併分支
git checkout master
git merge feature/new-feature
```

